Weaponry fixed Blender knife worker — offline resource notice

This resource tree contains the fixed, macOS arm64 Blender 5.2.1 LTS sidecar
used by the isolated Weaponry knife prototype, together with the first-party
closed worker entrypoint and its compliance records. The sidecar is copied as
an application resource so a user of a matching packaged application does not
need to install Blender separately. This resource is macOS arm64 only; it is
not a cross-platform distribution claim.

