Weaponry worker
---------------

The fixed Python entrypoint is a first-party Weaponry prototype. It accepts
only the closed typed job described by the source manifest; it does not accept
caller Python, add-ons, URLs, executable paths, environment values, or network
access. It writes no Runtime, Store, CAS, candidate, version, approval, or
export state. Its source license is intentionally recorded as NOASSERTION in
the SPDX supplement until the repository's product/legal owner supplies a
standalone distribution license decision.

